    Make workflow concurrency configurable for rate-limited providers
    
    The analysis stage fans out deliberately, which doubles the instantaneous
    request rate. On the free NIM tier that turned out to be the difference between
    a run progressing and a run spending its retry budget on 429s.
    
    SE_AGENT_MAX_CONCURRENCY=1 serializes the graph, trading the parallelism for a
    halved request rate. The default is unchanged and still unbounded, because
    parallel analysis is the right shape when quota allows.
    
